/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Hydrus is our newest Autonomous Underwater Vehicle designed with modularity and future expansion in mind. Measuring 3 feet long, carrying a stereoscopic camera, 8 thrusters, dual torpedo launchers, and a more extensive sensor suite, Hydrus is a complete leap forward in capability from its predecessor. It is the foundation for future improvements both in software and hardware and represents the cumulative progress that the team has achieved.)
/E (Hydrus is our newest Autonomous Underwater Vehicle designed with modularity and future expansion in mind. Measuring 3 feet long, carrying a stereoscopic camera, 8 thrusters, dual torpedo launchers, and a more extensive sensor suite, Hydrus is a complete leap forward in capability from its predecessor. It is the foundation for future improvements both in software and hardware and represents the cumulative progress that the team has achieved.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
