/S /P
/E (Software is the brain of our AUV. From vision to motors, these are the spinal cords that combine everything together. The software collects data form sensors, process it, and make meaningful decisions from them. This team is composed by Computer Vision, Simulations, Software Architecture, Controls,  Embedded Systems.  )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
